bound-lock/1 about="Checks one fixed rational joint prior across two addition orders, chain sums, exact finite conditional-garbling hypotheses and ranking counterexamples; no causal inference, authority, public delivery or release readiness." at=witness:044/public-case-layout by=target form=interval measure=count needs=proofs/marginal-information.json|samples/laws/marginal-information/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/marginal-information/no/sample.json|vectors/laws/marginal-information.json|vectors/laws/policy.json role=demands scope=publication/evidence/marginal-information value=0..0
