bound-lock/1 about="Declared extensional convention: an origin is identified by its supplied set of coordinate/interval pairs. Equal extensions form one class. Distance between extensions is descriptive; it does not establish probabilistic independence." at=policy:law/A5 by=target form=alphabet kind=axiom measure=status needs=samples/yes/A5-origin-is-extension.json|samples/no/A5-origin-is-extension.json|vectors/atom/states-not-actions.json role=demands scope=law/A5-origin-is-extension value=present
bound-lock/1 about="Declared mixture only: shared activation f sends all selected sources to the same wrong label; otherwise errors are jointly iid conditional on truth at rate e across n labels. Unanimity is f+(1-f)*((1-e)^L+e^L/(n-1)^(L-1)); wrong unanimity omits the correct term. Reuses fitUnanimityModel; matching curves do not identify physical coordination, intention or a causal process. Partial causes and degenerate private channels retain counterexamples." at=policy:measure/coordination by=target form=alphabet kind=definition measure=status needs=proofs/coordination.json|vectors/laws/coordination.json role=demands scope=measure/coordination value=present
bound-lock/1 about="Every capacity limit states its hypotheses; finite information is computed from the handed model." at=witness:041/cleanup-models-and-contracts by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/041/finite-not-limit value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Every conjecture in full" at=witness:the-root-spoke-for-the-place by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/open/full value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Every operation this package offers, every law it states and every form it declares: {operations} operations, {laws} laws, {forms} forms." at=witness:the-root-spoke-for-the-place by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/reference/lead value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Every quantity a system answers for has two marks on one scale. The floor is what must hold, the ceiling is what may hold, and the pair is a cell. Two origins that touch one cell and whose marks meet make information; two whose marks do not meet make a fork that no average can close.\n\nFour words carry the whole library. A floor, a ceiling, an origin and an epoch. A price is the distance between the marks, a state is where they stand, a verdict is what an origin found, a horizon is what no origin has reached, and none of them is a new idea: each is read off those four.\n\nThe pure API `@lapxo/obligations/measures` describes error histories of origins: covariance, spectrum, effective rank and common variance. It ships M/3 as the reference conditional model with an exact rational evaluator. No measure changes a state; observed association never establishes independence. [Measures](docs/measures.md)." at=witness:040/presentation-two-pages by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/idea value=present
bound-lock/1 about="Exact M0 independent-Bernoulli expectation gives R2=p^2+(1-p)^2+2c^2 p(1-p) sum w^2 for normalized declared shares; this identity is checked generally in Lean by expect_quadratic and pair_coincidence. Triple agreement satisfies R3=(3R2-1)/2 and adds no independent equation. Population agreement is not majority error or causal identification. Finite distinct-member sampling needs gamma_N, and observed data still need calibration, justified reference and uncertainty.\n" at=witness:obligations045 by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/contracts/m0-pair-coincidence shape=docs/contracts/m0-pair-coincidence.md value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Exact conditional procedure and state-preservation quartet; native two-place fixture captures exist. Root selected-context publication and release admission remain required." at=witness:042/native-quartet-closeout by=target form=interval measure=count needs=docs/measures.md|samples/measures/common-cause-capacity.json|vectors/measures/common-cause-capacity.cli.json role=demands scope=publication/measures/common-cause-capacity value=0..0
bound-lock/1 about="Exact conditional procedure and state-preservation quartet; native two-place fixture captures exist. Root selected-context publication and release admission remain required." at=witness:042/native-quartet-closeout by=target form=interval measure=count needs=docs/measures.md|samples/measures/confidence.json|vectors/measures/confidence.cli.json role=demands scope=publication/measures/confidence value=0..0
