bound-lock/1 about="Execute the exact conditional M0 model-to-implementation proof, 22 theorem axiom audits and three named compiler negatives. Joint member product law required; no general diagonal, c=1, identification, root receipt, public delivery or release readiness is certified." at=witness:obligations046/m0-binomial-bridge by=target form=interval measure=count needs=proofs/m0-046/BridgeNegatives.lean|proofs/m0-046/M0Bridge.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045/ConsensusGrid.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045/M0Coincidence.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045/M0Diagonal.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045/M0Limit.lean|proofs/m0-046/Obligations045/M0Offdiag.lean|proofs/m0-046/lake-manifest.json|proofs/m0-046/lakefile.toml|proofs/m0-046/lean-toolchain|vectors/laws/m0-binomial-bridge.lean.json|contracts/m0-binomial-bridge.json|docs/contracts/m0-binomial-bridge.md|samples/laws/m0-binomial-bridge/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/m0-binomial-bridge/no/sample.json|samples/laws/m0-binomial-bridge/yes/small-binomial-table.json|samples/laws/m0-binomial-bridge/no/pairwise-is-not-joint.json|vectors/laws/policy.json role=demands scope=publication/evidence/m0-binomial-bridge value=0..0
