bound-lock/1 about="Research status: experiment for the declared finite field, weights, seed, draw, spread and look budget. choose scores current reach, coherence at period 8, graph degree and log2(1+held width) under the handed four weights; play counts its specified closing/fork/coverage events. The recorded mixed weights outperform the recorded specialist weights on that fixture. Universal dominance for all fields, weights, draws or objectives is open and is not implied by component-bridge optimisation." at=policy:law/T55 by=target form=alphabet kind=conjecture measure=status needs=samples/yes/T55-a-policy-is-four-weights.json|src/views/field/policy.ts|src/views/field/wave.ts|src/views/product/reach.ts|test/obligatory.test.ts restsOn=law/A1-encounter|law/D11-the-obligatory|law/T41-distance-is-the-walk-between-lookings|law/T49-amplitude-has-sign-and-phase role=demands scope=law/T55-a-policy-is-four-weights value=present
