bound-lock/1 about="Under the declared binary M0 conditional-population-iid member design, finite-cell pair discord has the published population disagreement mean. ForT jointly independent complete cells, the all-pairs average is a bounded whole-cell statistic: its tail is at most min(1,1/(4T epsilon^2)), not a bound withT multiplied by the number of pairs. External coverage-calibrated p,c boxes and their union error budgets propagate through the positive M0 denominator to a conditional outer K_eff enclosure. A denominator that may approach zero has no certified finite upper bound unless a valid external cap is declared. Missing calibration is unmeasured; an incompatible confidence box is not an unconditional rejection of the model. No finite interval establishes causal independence." at=witness:obligations046/m0-uncertainty-blocks by=target form=interval measure=count needs=proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/BridgeNegatives.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0BlockCoverage046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Bridge.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Diagonal046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0FiniteDiscord046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Interval046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Lindeberg046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Moments046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/M0Threshold046.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045/ConsensusGrid.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045/M0Coincidence.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045/M0Diagonal.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045/M0Limit.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045/M0Offdiag.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/Obligations045.lean|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/lake-manifest.json|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/lakefile.toml|proofs/m0-046-uncertainty/lean-toolchain|vectors/laws/m0-uncertainty-blocks.lean.json|contracts/m0-keff-interval.json|samples/laws/m0-keff-interval/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/m0-keff-interval/yes/api-rows.json|samples/laws/m0-keff-interval/no/sample.json|vectors/laws/policy.json|vectors/laws/m0-keff-interval.json role=demands scope=publication/evidence/m0-uncertainty/blocks value=0..0
