bound-lock/1 about="Under the declared joint independent Bernoulli member product, the existing sum n_i*q_i and sum n_i*q_i*(1-q_i) equal the actual mean and variance. These identities hold for every finite N. Marginals alone do not justify the variance sum, as the correlated-pair negative demonstrates." at=witness:obligations046/m0-diagonal-moments by=target form=interval measure=count needs=proofs/m0-046-diagonal/BridgeNegatives.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/M0Bridge.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/M0Diagonal046.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/M0Lindeberg046.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/M0Moments046.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/M0Threshold046.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045/ConsensusGrid.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045/M0Coincidence.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045/M0Diagonal.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045/M0Limit.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/Obligations045/M0Offdiag.lean|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/lake-manifest.json|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/lakefile.toml|proofs/m0-046-diagonal/lean-toolchain|vectors/laws/m0-diagonal-moments.lean.json|contracts/m0-diagonal-conditional.json|samples/laws/m0-diagonal-conditional/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/m0-diagonal-conditional/no/sample.json|vectors/laws/policy.json role=demands scope=publication/evidence/m0-diagonal-conditional/moments value=0..0
